\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Danke fürs Lesen, habt noch weiterhin viel Spaß im Forum und auf den Servern (<sup>während ich traurig hier rumsitze</sup>)</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":45132,"threadID":3437,"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","subject":"","time":1457985887,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1758,"username":"Sexy Vengeance","time":1457986087,"value":1},{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1457988887,"value":1},{"userID":2064,"username":"Gammly","time":1457989631,"value":1},{"userID":2165,"username":"Makaveli1967","time":1464093902,"value":1},{"userID":1563,"username":"aPex.","time":1473176438,"value":1},{"userID":2079,"username":"KeinAdmin Brillenträger","time":1457986003,"value":-1},{"userID":1125,"username":"Stabiler Jesus","time":1458075921,"value":-1},{"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","time":1459335827,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Cracks dir.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":45133,"threadID":3437,"userID":1125,"username":"Stabiler Jesus","subject":"","time":1457986035,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2079,"username":"KeinAdmin Brillenträger","time":1457986394,"value":1},{"userID":2064,"username":"Gammly","time":1457989627,"value":-1},{"userID":1447,"username":"iSh00ter","time":1458039762,"value":-1},{"userID":1983,"username":"Runningcore","time":1458078092,"value":-1},{"userID":2165,"username":"Makaveli1967","time":1464093913,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Craxto</strong></cite><p>Cracks dir.<br></p></blockquote><p>Ich möchte gerne den Spieleentwickler (welcher übrigens das Spiel alleine entwickelt, also ein One-Man Studio) unterstützen, jedoch habe ich aktuell nicht die finanziellen Mittel.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Desweiteren unterstütze ich diese illegalen Machenschaften nicht</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":45134,"threadID":3437,"userID":1758,"username":"Sexy Vengeance","subject":"","time":1457986236,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2064,"username":"Gammly","time":1457989623,"value":1},{"userID":1447,"username":"iSh00ter","time":1458039781,"value":1},{"userID":2165,"username":"Makaveli1967","time":1464093927,"value":1},{"userID":2079,"username":"KeinAdmin Brillenträger","time":1457986544,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wenn du keine finanziellen Mittel hast, kannst du auch keine Unterstützung aussprechen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Du leihst dir das Geld, um jemanden zu unterstützen. Absurd.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Besser wäre doch, du promotest den Entwickler. Das ist die Unterstützung, die er braucht.&quot;Jo der macht echt gute Arbeit, ALLEEIN, supportet den, wenn es euch gefällt!&quot; wäre hierfür der elegantere Anlauf.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":45135,"threadID":3437,"userID":1125,"username":"Stabiler Jesus","subject":"","time":1457986579,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2079,"username":"KeinAdmin Brillenträger","time":1457986662,"value":1},{"userID":2064,"username":"Gammly","time":1457989619,"value":-1},{"userID":1447,"username":"iSh00ter","time":1458039791,"value":-1},{"userID":2165,"username":"Makaveli1967","time":1464093950,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Super Beitrag Vengeance jedoch leihe ich es mir nicht. Ich möchte das Spiel gerne spielen und theoretisch unterstützt JEDER Kauf den Entwickler. Bitte schlag &quot;Spende&quot; nach und lasse dich belehren.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Schönen Abend <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":45136,"threadID":3437,"userID":2064,"username":"Gammly","subject":"","time":1457988071,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1125,"username